e":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悲しみの忘れ方 Documentary of 乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月10日に無事上映初日を迎え、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が故郷秋田にも舞台挨拶に行くことが出来ましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキュメンタリー映画の舞台挨拶で秋田に行けるなんて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46になったあの日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15歳だった私は想像していただろうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも遊びに行っていたイオンに入ってるTOHOシネマズ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの場所に乃木坂46として来た事が不思議で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもすっごく嬉しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また秋田に乃木坂46として帰れるように頑張りますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北ブロックという事で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台の皆さんにも舞台挨拶で映画のお話をする事が出来て、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東北にも乃木坂が広まっているのだと実感しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仙台はツアーの初日を飾るから、また8月にお会いしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/07/16/5864780/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアーの前に、皆さんに是非観て来て欲しい事がありますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},